{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れ様(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は横浜個別握手会だったよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さったみなさん、\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのひなちまふぁみりーさんが来て下さって、嬉しかったです(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で「ひなちまレーンから出てきた方は、みんな笑顔だね。」っと言って頂いたことがあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だか嬉しかったなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈はひなちまふぁみりーさんと握手してお話しするだけで、いつも笑顔になれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そんな元気をくれるひなちまふぁみりーさんの笑顔をみると、幸せな気持ちになるの..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして、笑顔の輪が繋がっていくのって、素敵なことだなって感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも大好きなひなちまふぁみりーさんと、笑顔溢れる場所をたくさん作っていきたいです(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつもありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日来られなかったふぁみりーさんへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部は、モフモフニットに猫耳をつけて、黒猫ちゃんをイメージしたよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型はゆるまき*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部は、白のファー付きトップスで白うさぎちゃんをイメージ\\( ˆ ˆ )/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型はハーフツインっぽく、髪の毛をねじってもらったよ*"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thの握手会は終わってしまったけど、10thの握手会はまだまだあるので、ひなちまってますねヾ(*´∀｀*)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は...あみのお誕生日！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう☆\nいつも面白くて明るいあみが大好きよヾ(´︶`    )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月はハロウィンの月ということで、今日は殆どのメンバーが仮装をしていました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんは、サリー。\nとっても美しくて、似合ってる＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみはうさぎちゃん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりは黒うさぎ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりらぶ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりあはアリス。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/10/18/4236563/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹ちゃんみたいで可愛い(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋にたくさんの動物やキャラクターが溢れていて、面白かったです☆笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":